674335271088191_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oo63o2jmTsgQ7kNvwG5wjQP&_nc_oc=Ado558a4y2j9F1-vGWV5CTexLvVtntu8d8mx_MpFrSD71-0d-IlJ7mk_x2IeQUhUjIQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJOZ-T_57_X-L-HrgyNA3iWvJLEvs5eifrRPNUIgSeJng&oe=6AB2957E"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1365002872273178", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827626_1365002875606511_680623144893069867_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-f5q6rRQfjwQ7kNvwHllJht&_nc_oc=AdqETaAAGJHYbbHP5IH-9gEJcZAzIRnK4M_QCoArHH-dcVH-NbwhhKOOhIebHJx_Vdk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIDNRfVSyYPgzJd1pC3iDiYzZU_-2OHdLruLLQ5A_-3lg&oe=6AB27BFA"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1345063124419869", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_1345063127753202_3114028335302026247_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dgQv2oaHWi0Q7kNvwFVpbD1&_nc_oc=Ado2gYYzsrx1EIBNNMJRF-5oXBRKa0xG-bxle1QH1aiA-QO9zWf11vKy1AzjPcS9KhI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL_8hdL_PeJrlVXXW4QHHQp_pNDCpCY_Pd2qwB7S6AgkA&oe=6AB29574"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1645920806494975", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_1645920809828308_4500634967897063640_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JOM8cq-S_1AQ7kNvwEaVMFX&_nc_oc=Adp_foY9v-YZKGtM6SrOkZAQKrdyD3UEhdWEVd30Q2P6HATdSS77GbsKnL8XTOzHXwg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQ6ckr6lj_hEvm-8RvtVA24VTNMJwWV0v8j5oVhJisgQ&oe=6AB2A4BC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Arcade Shooter: Space Alien Sunrise", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Shooter"], "long_description": "### Arcade Shooter: Space Alien Sunrise\n\nStep onto the red planet in **Arcade Shooter: Space Alien Sunrise**. Inspired by classic cabinet shooters, this game brings fast-paced, action-packed gameplay directly to VR. Survive the alien onslaught on an unforgiving Martian landscape.\n\n---\n\n#### Procedural Martian Terrain\nNo two battles are the same. Every deployment features an **automatically generated Martian terrain**, providing new tactical challenges, ridges, and vantage points to adapt to.\n\n#### Survive the Night\nTime is your enemy. Use the daytime to find your bearings, because when the sun sets, the real test begins. The night cycle **multiplies the alien horde**, sending aggressive waves from all directions. Survive as many nights as possible to set your high score.\n\n#### Tools for Survival\nTo stay alive against the overwhelming odds, master your movement and resources:\n\n* **Jetpack:** Gain the high ground, escape tight spots, and maneuver through valleys.\n* **Tactical Gear:** Use grenades to clear enemy clusters and health packs to recover.\n* **Supply Drops:** Watch the skies. Ammo replenishment drops from above when you need it most.\n\n---\n\nWhether you love retro shooters or want a challenging VR action game, *Arcade Shooter: Space Alien Sunrise* offers a focused and highly repeatable combat loop. Gear up and see how many nights you can survive.", "short_description": "Nostalgia meets VR! Dodge, weave, and blast through waves of hostile invaders in Arcade Shooter: Space Alien Sunrise. Experience classic shoot-'em-up mechanics revitalized for modern headsets. Grab your blasters, defend the galaxy, and claim your spot on the leaderboard."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mikalaikazei.github.io/ArcadeShooter.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mikalai Kazei", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mikalaikazei.github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "e